---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Pricing"
  description="CoreFlow pricing is scoped to your team size and the modules you need. No published numbers yet — talk to us for a quote."
>
  <section class="intro">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="kicker">Pricing</span>
      <h1>Pricing scoped to your business, not a one-size table</h1>
      <p class="dek">
        We're early-stage and working with a small number of pilot customers, so pricing isn't a
        fixed self-serve table yet — it depends on team size and which modules you need. Book a
        free consultation and we'll give you a real number for your actual use case, not a
        placeholder.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="model">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>How pricing works</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Per-user</h3>
          <p>Priced by the number of people who need access — you don't pay for modules your team doesn't use.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Scoped to your modules</h3>
          <p>Start with what you actually need — Sales, Inventory, Procurement, Finance, Approvals — and add more as you grow.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>No hidden setup costs</h3>
          <p>Whatever we quote you is what you pay — onboarding and setup are part of the conversation, not a surprise line item.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Get a real number</h2>
      <p>Tell us your team size and what you need — we'll give you a straight answer in the same conversation.</p>
      <a class="btn-primary" href="/about#consultation">Book a Free Consultation</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .wrap {
    max-width: var(--content-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }
  .intro {
    padding: 64px 0 48px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-core);
  }
  .intro h1 {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 40px);
    margin-top: 10px;
    max-width: 22ch;
  }
  .dek {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 17px;
    margin-top: 14px;
    max-width: 62ch;
  }
  .model {
    padding: 56px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .model h2 {
    font-size: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  .card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 22px;
  }
  .card h3 {
    font-size: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .card p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .cta-band {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 64px 0;
  }
  .cta-band p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 52ch;
    margin: 12px auto 26px;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--color-flow);
    color: var(--color-on-flow);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 15px;
    padding: 13px 22px;
    border-radius: 9px;
  }
</style>
